# Bare-named Go binaries compiled with `go build` (Mach-O on macOS, ELF on
# Linux — no extension on either). Each `cmd/<name>/main.go` produces a
# binary of the same name at the repo root. Team rebuilds locally with
# `go build ./cmd/<name>` or skips the build via `go run ./cmd/<name>`.
deploy-spl-test-tokens
solana-key-to-base58
relayer
solver
privacy-router
test-relay-proxy
verify-prediction
fund-test-safe
deploy-tee-safes
deploy-test-safe
safe-transfer-out
test-safe-deploy

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Solana keypair JSON files — these are 64-byte ed25519 SECRET keys, never commit.
# Solver / relayer wallets live here by default; back them up out-of-repo.
*-solana.json
solver-solana.json
relayer-solana.json

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out

